> "> fit <- sem(model, data=y)
> Error in `[.data.frame`(data, , unlist(ov.names)) :
>    undefined columns selected

This means that you have variable names in your model syntax that do not
appear in your data.frame. Note that R is case-sensitive.

To get the observed variable names of your model, type in R:

ov.names <- lavaanNames(lavaanify(model), type="ov")
ov.names

To get the variable names in your data, type in R:

data.names <- names(y)

To find out which ones are missing, type in R:

ov.names %in% data.names

Everything should be 'TRUE'.

Yves.

